<title>UK: AHB doubles size of Jan 2006 FRN to 1.0 bln marks.</title>
<headline>AHB doubles size of Jan 2006 FRN to 1.0 bln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible floating rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JAN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.18    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO 500 MLN DEM LAUNCHED 31.OCT AT 100.185.</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  HOME CTRY   GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
